[6.39038, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1mhop-tap v0.2.7\u001b[0m installed (mode: standalone).\r\n\r\n"]
[6.39068, "o", "Local access:\r\n  \u001b[1mtap list\u001b[0m                          # sessions you can see\r\n  \u001b[1mtap snapshot <pty>\u001b[0m                # current screen\r\n  \u001b[1mtap watch <pty>\u001b[0m                   # live byte stream\r\n  \u001b[1mtap repl\u001b[0m                          # interactive REPL\r\n\r\n"]
[6.390835, "o", "  Permission model: root sees every session; non-root users\r\n  see only sessions opened by themselves. Authenticated by\r\n  SO_PEERCRED on the daemon's local socket (no claims trusted).\r\n\r\nService control: \u001b[1msudo systemctl status hop-tap\u001b[0m\r\nLogs:            \u001b[1msudo journalctl -u hop-tap -f\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[6.390943, "o", "\r\n\u001b[0;33mStandalone mode:\u001b[0m hop is not installed or not running on this host.\r\n"]
[6.391014, "o", "To enable \u001b[1mhop <host> tap ...\u001b[0m from remote peers:\r\n  curl -fsSL https://hop.keik.ai/install-daemon.sh | bash\r\n  curl -fsSL https://tap.keik.ai/install.sh | bash    # re-run, will register\r\n"]
